     "title": "Southbound for winter weather",
     "detail": "Express lanes stay southbound for winter weather\nBeginning at 8 p.m. on Friday, Dec. 2, the I-5 Express Lanes will switch to the southbound direction and remain open in that configuration until Monday, Dec. 5 due to expected winter weather in the forecast. Weather conditions will be reassessed on Monday morning to determine whether there will be a normally scheduled weekday reversal to northbound. Please check back on this page often for updates.",
